<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 92,027.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 92,027.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of January 13 totaled 92,027 bales, up from 90,918 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,109 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 1,106 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk 212 859 1640))</p>
